                    <h2 class="sub">                    Multi-Pattern Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The Behringer C-3 is a multi-pattern condenser with a small-diaphragm capsule and a transformerless output circuit.</p><p>The mic features a dual-sided 16mm capsule, switchable low cut, -10dB attenuation, die cast metal body and red LED +48V indicator.</p><p>The C-3 ships with plastic hardmount and plastic foam-lined case.<p>The <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Behringer/C-3">Behringer C-3</a> is also known as: C3.</p><p>The mic was released in 2006.</p>
